Package: kifbetadiversity
Title: Confidence Intervals and Hypothesis Tests for Beta Diversity
Version: 0.2.0
Authors@R:
    person("Oded", "Hollander", , "odedhollander23@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Computes Whittaker's multiplicative beta diversity from
    site-by-species presence/absence data, using a first-order jackknife
    estimate of regional richness (gamma) to account for incomplete
    sampling, with an analytical confidence interval and a two-sample
    hypothesis test, following Kiflawi & Spencer (2004, Ecology
    85(10):2895-2900). Includes a helper that reshapes raw long-format
    field records into the required site-by-species matrix.
URL: https://github.com/OdedHol/kifbetadiversity
BugReports: https://github.com/OdedHol/kifbetadiversity/issues
